{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Facilitate a referendum on Scottish independence from the UK",
        "additional_details": "We believe a referendum on Scottish independence from the UK is better than telling the people of Scotland that they do not want independence, or that the majority of people in Scotland do not want a referendum. The UK Government should let the people of Scotland decide.",
        "background": "The current Prime Minister of the UK said he was determined to prove the First Minister of Scotland wrong when he said the current British Prime Minister would be the last Prime Minister of the UK. We believe the best way to do this is to facilitate a referendum on Scottish independence from the UK.",
